<title>UK: Albert Fisher says gets bid approach.</title>
<headline>Albert Fisher says gets bid approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food processing and distribution company Albert Fisher Group Plc said on Friday it had received an approach which may or may not lead to an offer for the company.</p>
<p>Albert Fisher gained 11 3/4 pence to 46p in high trading volume of more than 10 million shares by 0800 GMT.</p>
<p>The company did not name the possible bidder.</p>
